      "title": "Improper Resource Shutdown or Release in io.undertow:undertow-core",
      "description": "Affected versions of io.undertow:undertow-core are vulnerable to Allocation of Resources Without Limits or Throttling / Improper Resource Shutdown or Release. Undertow's HTTP handling fails to count malformed requests that trigger server\u2010side stream resets against its abuse limits. A malicious client can repeatedly send crafted requests that abort streams without bumping abuse counters, forcing excessive server workload and resulting in a denial-of-service.",
